// Wing-Overload manager archetype — hand-authored, NOT LLM-baked.
//
// A flank-oriented tactician who manufactures 3-on-2 + 4-on-3 overloads in
// the wide channels by pulling wide forwards deeper to combine with full-
// backs + wide midfielders. Risk appetite slightly above neutral (will
// commit wide players forward); possession preference slightly above
// neutral (likes ball circulation but ultimately to manufacture wide
// overload, not to keep for keeping's sake).
